Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:12.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助的眼中再次浮现出神秘画面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:17.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那是哥哥以前看过的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:22.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,梦人已经策划了两起犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.57,0:00:27.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,借助神秘的左眼 爱之助试图与哥哥对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:31.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼侦探EYE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:02.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你哥哥不是在爆炸中丧生了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.23,0:01:09.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他跟现在发生的这些事 是不是有什么关联？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:15.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:30.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信您 所以才告诉您
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:39.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其实还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:41.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.34,0:01:47.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且他就在警察局……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:52.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就在这个搜查本部里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:58.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.30,0:02:05.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我哥哥现在用的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:09.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:13.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂刑警就是我哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.61,0:02:17.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:24.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥伪造了自己的死亡 
一直在暗中制定犯罪计划
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.13,0:02:49.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在只差确认那个人的身份了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:53.60,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要所有鉴定结果一出来 就能查明了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:57.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:02:59.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,区政府大楼发生爆炸了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:07.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连我也不知道他的目的究竟是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:15.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我能看到每次犯罪的细节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:22.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,靠着我的左眼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.69,0:03:23.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,左眼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:28.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我做过角膜移植 捐赠者是我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.67,0:03:32.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,从那以后 只要头部受到撞击
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:37.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就能看到哥哥曾经看过的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:38.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您可以不信 但这是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:42.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谁会相信这种事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:43.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:49.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那您怎么解释我破获了那些案件？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:55.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥威胁过我……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:00.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果我敢说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:06.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他就会杀了听我说的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 爱之助呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:16.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在和福地警视谈话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:20.13,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是吗？真好奇他们在聊什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:22.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我赶时间 先失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.93,0:04:34.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,未知号码
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.49,0:04:38.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:42.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初次见面 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:47.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么知道我的号码的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:50.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:54.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你刚听到了很有意思的事 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:05:00.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果想知道真相
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:06.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就到胜名町的停车场来 
最好一个人来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:07.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:12.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不用担心 不会像对那个警察一样
朝你开枪的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:21.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:24.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,下次再谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:29.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,您没听见我刚才说的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:39.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果告诉别人 哥哥会……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,杀掉他的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我听得清清楚楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然确实难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:49.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但要是有人试图杀我 真相就大白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:53.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也就有证据了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:58.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:07.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我好歹是个刑警 自保的能力还是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:18.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:19.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:22.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视有生命危险
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要把我放出去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:00.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你好 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:04.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天我要把我的老板介绍给您
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.70,0:08:14.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,辛苦了 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,向坂……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,混蛋……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:04.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想在最后把一切都向您交代清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.76,0:09:06.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:14.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.81,0:09:18.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道是真的……？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.23,0:09:25.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 我就是你们一直在找的犯人 田中梦人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:31.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,潜入你们搜查本部实在太容易了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.03,0:09:35.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警方的人事档案管理到处都是漏洞
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:41.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,永别了 福地警视
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:10.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,辛苦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:13.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.87,0:10:19.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好冷啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.09,0:10:29.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视到底去哪儿了……？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:33.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那爆炸案该怎么办……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.16,0:10:33.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么爆炸？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.95,0:10:35.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你们在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 向坂刑警现在在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是联系不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.01,0:10:48.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是加藤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:52.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.96,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我马上来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:11:00.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.54,0:11:04.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又发生了一起爆炸……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.84,0:11:07.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,而且福地警视……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:11.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,殉职了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.38,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是我的错……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:30.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.26,0:11:32.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:41.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.96,0:11:45.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.61,0:11:50.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快冷静下来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:11.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你看到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:17.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我什么都没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:19.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:25.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,最好什么都别看见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:31.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经受够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:41.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤刑警！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地先生……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.63,0:13:13.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:18.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,都是因为我……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:23.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:28.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,照顾好他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:45.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你是最后一个和福地警视说话的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:51.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你知道什么 能告诉我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.99,0:14:01.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地警视说和你谈了很重要的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谈了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:15.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:21.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想爱之助今天受的刺激已经够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:27.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:42.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:44.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我送你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.93,0:14:46.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,谢谢老师送我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:04.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:08.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我可以留下来陪你一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:12.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想一个人待着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:24.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 欢迎回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你听说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:29.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,吉田先生最近去打零工了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:32.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以现在由我来顶替他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:41.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他出什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:24.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在由宫元刑警接任课长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:29.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是宫元正己
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.84,0:16:35.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接替福地先生的工作 我深感责任重大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:39.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们无论如何都要抓住犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.55,0:16:40.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,听明白了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:41.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.65,0:16:43.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请回座
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:49.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我要听取每个人的汇报
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:51.84,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,首先是鉴识结果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:54.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,鉴识结果显示
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.61,0:16:57.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,使用的是遥控炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:03.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,其残骸与区政府大楼爆炸案中所使用的完全一致
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:06.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,连环爆炸案吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:16.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！快起床
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:19.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是再不起床 我就破门而入了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:21.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我进来了哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:22.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,外面冷死了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:23.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:30.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,居然连门都没锁……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.22,0:17:34.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,到底在想什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:41.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师一大早来干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:43.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,今天可是周日啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:46.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别吓我啊 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没干什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:54.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 画本 我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:59.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不知道你的左眼这次又看到了什么画面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:02.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可是你什么都没画啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.11,0:18:02.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:04.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我看你昨天好像看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:06.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我决定不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你听我说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:14.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在福地先生遇害前几个小时 
区政府大楼也发生了另一起爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:18.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,简直就像推理小说一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:21.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,犯人都是同一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大概吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,太吓人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:33.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是还要炸的话 干脆把我的债务也一起炸飞算了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:34.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:38.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作点 爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:43.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说了 我不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:47.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不再去阻止犯罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:56.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道你不想给福地先生报仇了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:19:00.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你只是太难过了 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:05.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我又能怎样……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:11.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我根本什么都做不了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:17.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作点！你在胡思乱想什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:27.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就算你的左眼偶尔会失灵 派不上用场……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:32.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没法每次都完美地阻止犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是 但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:40.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,和你一起 爱之助 我们确实帮到了警方的调查啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:44.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也救了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.57,0:19:50.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,别管我了……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:57.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你就是个大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:20:00.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你已经消沉了一整夜了 
也该够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.58,0:20:03.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看看外面天气多好！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:07.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,振作起来 去阻止犯罪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:11.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我说了 别管我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.84,0:20:23.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师你真的很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:27.45,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,烦死了……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:30.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,让我一个人待着
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:41.31,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:49.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我是因为担心你才来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:57.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我知道……像我这种人……其实并没有什么了不起的才能……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.41,0:21:07.77,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但即使这样……我也想能帮上一点忙……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:11.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我一直都在拼命努力啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.30,0:21:14.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果像我这样没用的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:18.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也能帮到爱之助一点忙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:24.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就会觉得自己还有点用 
所以我才那么努力！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.27,0:21:26.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可你居然说出这种话？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.27,0:21:37.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是因为你的左眼 我也不会卷进这些案子里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:48.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:56.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,以后再也别来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:05.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:32.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,气死我了 气死我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.39,0:22:35.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,必须马上去买买买！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:38.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助这个大笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:03.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么回事……买了这么多东西 心情却一点都没变好……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.61,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:35.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你现在在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:38.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,在哪都无所谓……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:43.65,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又发生爆炸了 请马上来日之出广场
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:47.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生 我已经不想再……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:48.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.72,0:23:51.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果你想为福地先生报仇的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:53.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,就和我们一起破案吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.67,0:23:55.73,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.61,0:23:59.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:02.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.49,0:24:09.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过我给你发几段现场视频 请你务必看一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.19,0:24:35.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,树突然爆炸了 想要逃跑的人都摔倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.77,0:24:43.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,大家现在都还惊魂未定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.29,0:24:49.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,发生得太突然了 那个孩子要是
再靠近一米 可能就没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:53.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,拜托你们 一定要抓住犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.33,0:25:01.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.26,0:25:03.49,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.53,0:25:05.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.07,0:25:13.07,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来想买买东西散散心 结果突然发生了爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.85,0:25:19.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我对你说了那么过分的话 这是我的报应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.73,0:25:23.83,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,说过分的话的人是我才对……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:30.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过 爱之助 有句话我想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.74,0:25:43.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你说自己一无是处……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.92,0:25:46.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我完全不这么认为
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.66,0:25:59.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然我们只是老师和学生 能做的事情很少
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.03,0:26:13.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但我知道 爱之助……你比任何人都善良
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.72,0:26:21.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,比任何人都富有正义感
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.11,0:26:30.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有人能像你一样 全心全意地为别人付出
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.03,0:26:38.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以 爱之助 我不想看到你自责
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.98,0:26:45.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪怕全世界都与你为敌……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:53.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我也会一直觉得 爱之助是全世界最棒的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.91,0:27:05.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,啊 对了 看我买了这个……很可爱吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.11,0:27:06.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是啊 真的很可爱……
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.85,0:27:37.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.55,0:27:44.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生……如果老师还在的话 能让她接下电话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.41,0:27:46.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.36,0:27:55.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.94,0:27:58.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.33,0:28:02.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 让你担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.06,0:28:07.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对不起 我刚才对你说了过分的话
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:11.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.73,0:28:15.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我不会再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.90,0:28:28.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把你和福地先生害成这样的人 
我绝对不会原谅他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.98,0:28:37.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会用这只左眼找到他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:42.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我相信你 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.36,0:28:49.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等包扎好伤口 我马上赶过去
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.16,0:28:51.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.44,0:29:39.20,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可恶 这到底是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.00,0:29:46.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等……
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.16,0:29:50.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在哪里见过这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:30:00.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,荻田怎么会在爆炸发生的时候 
偏偏请了一周的假？！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.23,0:30:04.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要不是有您在 我们都找不到人顶替 
您真是帮了大忙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.24,0:30:07.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里 能有工作我已经很感激了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:11.85,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.85,0:30:14.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 这个……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.16,0:30:18.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,“南部”商场的标志？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.72,0:30:20.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好像是的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.03,0:30:23.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你今天在哪里值班？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.40,0:30:25.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我现在就去南部商场
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:27.17,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我代表荻田先生向您道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.17,0:30:30.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没事 那我出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.47,0:30:40.30,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 出发吧 
- 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.44,0:30:50.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.94,0:30:52.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,想了解一下关于日之出广场爆炸案的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:55.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请调出当时的监控录像
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:31:01.08,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 你还记得之前炸弹都伪装成了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.34,0:31:11.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我想想……先是地球仪 然后是摄像机 接着是树
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.72,0:31:17.70,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,对 每次都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.70,0:31:22.71,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以根本猜不到下次会是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.69,0:31:27.58,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,看来那棵树周围并没有什么可疑举动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.58,0:31:29.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,录像真的全都在这了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.75,0:31:32.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是的 都在这了……
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:52.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 答应我一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.06,0:31:53.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.51,0:31:58.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一遇到危险 你一定要先逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.99,0:32:00.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.47,0:32:06.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是不答应 我就不带你一起去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.92,0:32:10.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.51,0:32:22.00,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,出示本优惠券的顾客 
全场商品均可享受七折优惠
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:24.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,好便宜啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.11,0:32:28.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,消费金额最高的顾客 还将获得精美礼品一份
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.78,0:32:37.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,刑警先生 自称是爆炸案主谋的人打来电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.06,0:32:38.06,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:45.80,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,接进来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:48.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.11,0:32:52.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,初次见面 你就是接替福地警视的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.16,0:32:57.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在由我负责这起案件 我叫宫元
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.01,0:32:58.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,福地的事真是对不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.97,0:33:00.92,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不过说实话 我本来没打算杀他的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:02.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,少在那胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.21,0:33:04.54,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一定会让你被判死刑！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.54,0:33:07.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,话可别说得这么满
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.93,0:33:11.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,之前的都只是小打小闹 重头戏还在后头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.76,0:33:21.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我在一家大型商场里装了威力巨大的炸弹 一旦爆炸 至少会有5000人丧命
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.97,0:33:24.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们来做笔交易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:34.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我本来想开价一条人命一亿日元 
不过考虑到金融危机 政府预算也挺吃紧的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.53,0:33:38.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那就折中一下 按一人一千万算吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.53,0:33:38.86,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,希望你们能把里面的所有顾客都赎回去
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.86,0:33:41.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,五百亿日元？！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.46,0:33:47.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你的意思是 一条人命连一千万都不值吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.16,0:33:48.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.81,0:33:51.81,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,五百亿日元数额太大了 根本没法一下子筹齐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.81,0:33:54.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那我可就没办法了 不给钱的话 我可就要按下按钮了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.94,0:33:57.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,等等……好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.25,0:33:59.33,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们会付钱的 但筹钱需要时间
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.33,0:34:01.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,随你们的便
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.01,0:34:04.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,截止时间是中午十二点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.34,0:34:07.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,现在只剩二十分钟了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.64,0:34:09.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.09,0:34:10.09,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂？！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.77,0:34:13.02,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,追踪到信号了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.02,0:34:14.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.05,0:34:18.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,调查所有类似的先例 
立刻联络防爆特警队！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.78,0:34:19.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.61,0:34:30.24,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,像这样在商场里瞎找根本没用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:32.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.72,0:34:37.57,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.44,0:34:40.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.52,0:34:42.25,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.25,0:34:43.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.75,0:34:46.90,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么能在这种地方……
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:50.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.91,0:35:10.94,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.94,0:35:19.39,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,那个保安……难道被当作谷田部尸体的就是他？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.93,0:35:22.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.86,0:35:24.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 出大事了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.68,0:35:32.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,加藤先生说警方接到报案 有人在某处安装了炸弹 而且十二点就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.47,0:35:34.01,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,把电话给我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.01,0:35:37.74,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 喂！
- 爱之助 情况就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.74,0:35:41.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,虽然听起来很荒唐 但你知不知道是哪家商场？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.99,0:35:43.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,是南部商场！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.51,0:35:45.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们已经在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:46.44,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:51.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还有……那个被冒充成谷田部的死者 身份查出来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.66,0:35:55.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还在调查 目前还没线索
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.63,0:35:59.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他可能是一名保安
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.53,0:36:01.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,保安？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:06.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请转告负责确认身份的人 
一旦查到了就马上打给我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.79,0:36:09.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,怎么了 爱之助？这和尸体有什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.76,0:36:19.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,各位顾客请注意 我们接到通知 
南部商场内被安放了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.64,0:36:25.36,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,炸弹威力极大 请大家尽快撤离商场
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.39,0:36:34.69,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快点 快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.48,0:36:57.05,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,播报得真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.05,0:37:00.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,引爆准备都做好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.55,0:37:01.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,当然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.89,0:37:05.51,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只要穿着这身制服 就绝对没人会怀疑我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.51,0:37:09.16,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,假扮成保安行动起来方便多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.54,0:37:13.34,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,办完事还能神不知鬼不觉地离开
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.22,0:37:31.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快走吧 这栋楼马上就要被夷为平地了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.49,0:37:36.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？要不要也先撤出去？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.37,0:37:43.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 那个是……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.97,0:37:50.40,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.40,0:37:52.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,黑猩猩玩偶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.41,0:37:54.41,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道炸弹是……
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.41,0:37:57.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪一层？
- 在九楼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.49,0:38:02.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,得赶紧打给加藤先生！黑猩猩 黑猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.49,0:38:27.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.76,0:38:30.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 快跑吧 十二点就要爆炸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.99,0:38:32.88,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.88,0:38:34.15,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只剩4分钟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.15,0:38:35.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.22,0:38:37.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.12,0:38:38.52,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我已经决定不再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.73,0:38:42.26,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果阻止不了犯罪 我宁可死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.26,0:38:44.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.46,0:39:08.55,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.04,0:39:11.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,难道这些线……
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.69,0:39:14.53,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,红 -> 绿 -> 黄 -> 蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.55,0:39:16.78,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,这是拆除炸弹的顺序吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.78,0:39:18.76,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不 我也不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.97,0:39:25.87,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,如果这是组装炸弹的顺序 那么剪断红线就会引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.05,0:39:29.99,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,只剩3分钟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.99,0:39:35.56,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 别忘了您的承诺
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.97,0:39:39.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.03,0:39:41.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.02,0:39:45.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我会尽量把它带到更远的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.46,0:39:47.66,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.56,0:39:51.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,喂 加藤先生
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.29,0:39:54.46,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们找到炸弹了！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.06,0:40:09.93,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.93,0:40:11.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 快开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.82,0:40:13.23,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.23,0:40:14.27,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.27,0:40:17.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道该怎么拆除炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.36,0:40:23.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,万一弄错了可不是闹着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.21,0:40:25.95,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,所以我绝对不能给您开门！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.95,0:40:28.22,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.69,0:40:42.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,红 -> 绿 -> 黄 -> 蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.13,0:40:44.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,要是弄错了……
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.38,0:40:50.43,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就会死在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:55.37,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.07,0:41:07.97,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.68,0:41:13.47,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不要犹豫……彻底相信这只眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.79,0:41:56.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.49,0:42:00.79,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.21,0:42:17.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助在外面！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.82,0:42:29.29,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 爱之助
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.62,0:42:34.12,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,老师 我好像成功把它拆除了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:36.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:40.03,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,稍有差错你就没命了！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.04,0:42:44.64,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你到底在想什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.44,0:42:53.11,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,你拆除了炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.11,0:42:56.72,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,还是个中学生 居然这么聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.72,0:43:00.68,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就说他直觉很敏锐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.68,0:43:02.67,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.67,0:43:05.89,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,警视总监一定会表彰你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.12,0:43:15.42,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我一点都不聪明……聪明的是我哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.39,0:43:18.04,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.04,0:43:27.62,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,他什么都知道 什么都做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.87,0:43:36.18,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我亲哥哥曾对我说……
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.42,0:43:48.32,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,不到三个月 我就会杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.92,0:43:52.50,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.04,0:44:00.21,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,但是……他算错了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.30,0:44:15.91,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,可才过了不到两个月 在得知福地警视殉职 又有疯子在四处引爆炸弹之后……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:29.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我就已经下定决心——绝不再退缩 不再抱有任何指望
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.24,0:44:40.35,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,也不再寄希望于哥哥能改过自新
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.66,0:44:46.59,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不太明白你在说什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.91,0:44:52.19,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.46,0:45:04.14,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助 你大概是吓坏了吧 你需要好好休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.45,0:45:09.98,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,哥哥 我们一起死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.82,0:45:17.82,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,爱之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.22,0:45:33.48,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,本剧原声带CD将抽选赠送给50名观众
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.48,0:45:39.63,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,请写明住址 姓名 年龄 以及对节目的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.63,0:45:41.75,BottomCenter,,0,0,0,,我们等着您的来信
